{"id":"n63952-1-9","stage":5,"title":"손아귀 · 手心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63952-1-9-1","ko":"내가 선물로 준 장난감이 네 동생 마음에 든 것 같아?","zh":"我送的玩具，你弟弟好像很喜欢吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"선물로","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물로","audio":"/audio/29b159bf8e45509c413a.mp3"}},{"text":"준","meaning":"给","explanation":"주다：给；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"9","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준","audio":"/audio/380bd5afbff5e69e5943.mp3"}},{"text":"장난감이","meaning":"玩具","explanation":"장난감：玩具；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장난감","audio":"/audio/1202a938fbf31f6b843d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71207","senseId":"1","lemma":"장난감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장난감이","audio":"/audio/3c84b0b69d76ad76d000.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"동생","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}},{"text":"마음에","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음에","audio":"/audio/43f69e9e8e24ba2d0d8c.mp3"}},{"text":"든","meaning":"中意，称心，看中","explanation":"들다：中意，称心，看中；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"11","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"든","audio":"/audio/fa1c170a05a6a48fc7be.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"允许别人拥有或享有时间等。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"1202a938fbf31f6b","term":"장난감","zh":"玩具","audio":"/audio/1202a938fbf31f6b843d.mp3","entryId":"71207","definition":"小孩拿着玩的各种物品。","pronunciation":["장난깜"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"中意，称心，看中","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"觉得某物好。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8510425452820a9481b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63952-1-9-2","ko":"응. 재미있다면서 손아귀에 꼭 쥐고 다니더라.","zh":"嗯，他说很有趣，还一直紧紧攥在手里呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있다면서","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있다면서","audio":"/audio/8102dddd2011ed4f50d0.mp3"}},{"text":"손아귀에","meaning":"手心","explanation":"손아귀：手心；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"손아귀","audio":"/audio/0d3b4e4bcb7ffe7c67d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63952","senseId":"1","lemma":"손아귀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손아귀에","audio":"/audio/de98652561df781f8817.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"紧紧地用力摁或抓的样子。","explanation":"꼭：紧紧地用力摁或抓的样子。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28297","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"쥐고","meaning":"抓，捉","explanation":"쥐다：抓，捉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쥐다","audio":"/audio/3a84ef1f5dcdbf13b570.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17830","senseId":"2","lemma":"쥐다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쥐고","audio":"/audio/70cd551e3cdc09f7f35f.mp3"}},{"text":"다니더라.","meaning":"到处走动（쥐고 다니다：拿着到处走、随身拿着）","explanation":"다니다：到处走动（쥐고 다니다：拿着到处走、随身拿着）；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니더라","audio":"/audio/91d88feaa91ef1c8d55f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"0d3b4e4bcb7ffe7c","term":"손아귀","zh":"手心","audio":"/audio/0d3b4e4bcb7ffe7c67d4.mp3","entryId":"63952","definition":"拇指和其他四个手指之间。","pronunciation":["소나귀"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"紧紧地用力摁或抓的样子。","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"28297","definition":"紧紧地用力摁或抓的样子。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"3a84ef1f5dcdbf13","term":"쥐다","zh":"抓，捉","audio":"/audio/3a84ef1f5dcdbf13b570.mp3","entryId":"17830","definition":"